    "body": "I would also love to see this feature implemented. Probably with an option in the `display` section like this:\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[[battery.display]]\r\nthreshold = 10\r\nonly_on_discharge = true\r\n```\r\nWith this, you could have one configuration where the module appears when the battery charge is very low (e.g. 10%) regardless of charging state and another configuration for a relatively low charge (e.g. 20%) only if you are not charging your device.",
